  "//": "Repository-local type program for the dependency-free modules under adapters/dsh, plus the packaging scripts. Every such module is listed explicitly and `scripts/check-type-coverage.ts` fails when one is missing, so a new module cannot be added without a program covering it. Modules that import `@deepseek-ai/*` are compiled by adapters/dsh/typecheck-host.ts against a real isolated install.",
  "//usage": "bun node_modules/typescript/bin/tsc -p adapters/dsh/tsconfig.json",
